github.com/belluikit/goffmpeg-libs/android_amd64
================================================

lib/ contains FFmpeg libraries (https://ffmpeg.org) built for android_amd64:

  libavcodec.a libavformat.a libavutil.a libswresample.a libswscale.a

FFmpeg version: N-125841-ge2bc6d88cd (git revision e2bc6d88cd68184288c16570e04881c3a426a05a).
No local patches: goffmpeg's build applies patches/*.patch to the FFmpeg
checkout, and goffmpeg has no such files (BUILDING.md: "The directory is
currently empty").

License: GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later. The full
text is in LICENSE at the root of this repository, and is included in this
module's zip by the go command. The build used neither --enable-gpl nor
--enable-nonfree; each library reports "license: LGPL version 2.1 or later".

Configure line, as recorded in libavutil (avutil_configuration()). Absolute
build-machine paths are shortened: <goffmpeg> is the goffmpeg checkout on the
CI runner and <ndk-30.0.14904198> is the Android NDK of that version.

  --prefix=<goffmpeg>/internal/libav/dist/android_amd64 --extra-cflags=-fPIC --enable-pic --disable-autodetect --disable-programs --disable-doc --disable-debug --disable-encoders --disable-muxers --disable-avfilter --enable-swscale --enable-swresample --enable-network --arch=x86_64 --target-os=android --enable-cross-compile --disable-avdevice --enable-jni --enable-mediacodec --cc=<ndk-30.0.14904198>/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/darwin-x86_64/bin/x86_64-linux-android21-clang --cross-prefix=<ndk-30.0.14904198>/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/darwin-x86_64/bin/llvm- --nm=<ndk-30.0.14904198>/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/darwin-x86_64/bin/llvm-nm --ar=<ndk-30.0.14904198>/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/darwin-x86_64/bin/llvm-ar --ranlib=<ndk-30.0.14904198>/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/darwin-x86_64/bin/llvm-ranlib --strip=<ndk-30.0.14904198>/toolchains/llvm/prebuilt/darwin-x86_64/bin/llvm-strip --enable-static --disable-shared

Corresponding source:
  FFmpeg:  https://github.com/belluikit/ffmpeg/tree/goffmpeg-e2bc6d88cd
           belluikit's mirror of FFmpeg. The tag is commit
           e2bc6d88cd68184288c16570e04881c3a426a05a and stays for as long as
